# neck/scarf: the scarf (A3's hero): the wrap and knot; the tail hangs at rest and flies in side walks (neck keys)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role neck scarf
layer neck
anchor neck
keys neck

view D key rest origin 5 0
|mpnnnnnnom
|.mponnnm..

view U key rest origin 5 0
|mpooooonnm

view R key flow origin 12 0
|.....mnmpooonnm
|-moonnnn.......
|.m--...m.......

view R key flow2 origin 11 1
|..mm..........
|.moon.mpooonnm
|...nnnn.......
|---...m.......

view R key rest origin 6 0
|.mpooonnm
|mn.......
|.m.......

view L key flow origin 3 0
|mpooonnnm...
|......-nnoom
|........--m.

view L key flow2 origin 3 1
|.........mm
|mpooonnmoom
|......nnn..
|.......--..

view L key rest origin 3 0
|mpooonnm.
|.......nm
|........m

